{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["No Home","Hae-Jun Go, who ran from home, and Eun-Yeong Baek, the problem child who lives in a tent. These two, who met under terrible circumstances, are forced to live together in an abandoned dormitory. This is a story of difficult growth between two people who hate both the dorm and each other.\n\n\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)"],"ja":["집이 없어",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-59868","ids":{"shikimori":59868,"mal":59868,"anilist":183744,"kodik":"serial-68727"},"kodikIds":["serial-63932","serial-68727"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-63932":"2024-12-22T18:09:34Z","serial-68727":"2025-07-13T18:11:15Z"},"title":"Бездомный","originalTitle":"Jibi Eopseo","alt":"No Home No Home 집이 없어","description":"Го Хэ Джун сбежал из дома, а Ынён Бэк Ын Ён — та ещё бунтарка, живущая в палатке, потому что дома у неё нет. Случайная встреча по злой прихоти судьбы приводит этих двоих к совместной жизни в старом заброшенном общежитии. Непростая история взросления двух людей, которым не нравится ни это общежитие, ни друг друга, но идти им больше некуда.","year":2024,"type":"ONA","genres":["Повседневность","Школа"],"rating":6.87,"popularity":2206,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/59868/0c9a6f0d3652456d7e76c630f7f74364.jpeg","width":700,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/98ea9bd8f954847027c83eef4d3f33f9ee81214e.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-63932","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1397461/82d8ebcdff00e5c72472c6cbc89eab5c/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id"